{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119327","id":3647141660,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZYvcc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119327.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119327","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119327/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119327/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119327/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4666f88777c56ca97592718a98f42736f72df4ba","number":119327,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add unit tests for `ItemList`","user":{"login":"calbebop","id":70987281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTg3Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70987281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop","html_url":"https://github.com/calbebop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Contributes to #43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `ItemList` covering:\r\n\r\n* Defaults: empty list, selection state, modes/columns/layout/behavior flags, plus constructor overrides (`FOCUS_ALL`, clip-contents, scrollbars)\r\n* Item CRUD with negative indices, `set_item_count` grow and shrink, `add_item` with `selectable=false`, `add_icon_item` round-trip\r\n* `clear()` resetting count, current, and selection, including the empty-list idempotent path\r\n* `remove_item` current-row semantics: clearing current in single mode, preserving current and selection when a later row is removed, and surviving selections when the current row is removed in multi mode\r\n* Selection in `SELECT_SINGLE`: replace, deselect resetting current to `-1`, no-op on disabled and non-selectable items, `deselect_all`\r\n* Selection in `SELECT_MULTI`: additive `select(idx, false)` vs. exclusive `select(idx)`, non-selecting `set_current`, single-row `deselect`, `deselect_all`\r\n* `move_item` updating current for the first selected row in single and multi modes\r\n* `sort_items_by_text` re-syncing current in single mode and leaving current untouched in multi mode (selection flags travel with items)\r\n* `find_metadata` round-trips for int, `String`, and `Vector2`, and not-found returning `-1`\r\n* Guards: `set_max_text_lines(0)`, `set_fixed_column_width(-1)`, out-of-range `TextDirection`, NaN `icon_scale`, out-of-range `remove_item`\r\n\r\nFork CI: workflow tests completed successfully on [`calbebop/godot`](https://github.com/calbebop/godot) for branch `test-item-list`.\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote and reviewed the changes, and validated style and behavior against `ItemList` in-tree. Cursor helped with research and drafting.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo